Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20JMAP=20batch=202=20fixup=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20thread=20host=20into=20=5Fconnect;=20catch=20Exception=20not?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Throwable?=
